<p>Sets the flag for visualizing if the anchor was placed using an ARRaycast. </p>
<dl class="params"><dt>Parameters</dt><dd>
  <table class="params">
    <tr><td class="paramname">isPlacedWithRaycast</td><td><code>true</code> if the anchor was placed using a raycast, otherwise <code>false</code>.</td></tr>
    <tr><td class="paramname">trackableHitType</td><td>The trackable that was hit with a raycast if a raycast was used to place the anchor.</td></tr>
  </table>
  </dd>
</dl>

</div>
</div>
